# External Service Integrations

## Overview

This project integrates three main external services:
1. **Supermemory** - Memory and context management for AI
2. **Browser-Use Cloud** - AI-powered browser automation
3. **Twilio** - Voice calls with OpenAI Realtime API

## Supermemory Integration

### Setup

```bash
npm install @supermemory/tools supermemory
```

Documentation: [docs/supermemory/README.md](mdc:docs/supermemory/README.md)

### AI SDK Tools Integration

```typescript
